5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help move the desks! I want to make sure we don't waste any time once we start. Let's make this the best layout ever!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep a level head. Before we get too excited, we should examine the data to ensure the new layout is actually sustainable and efficient for everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. We need a logical basis for the new arrangement to avoid any future complaints. Let's be thorough about what we investigate before we start sketching plans.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is fine, but let's not forget the human element. A plan that looks good on paper is useless if it's physically draining. I'm interested in the actual environment we'll be inhabiting.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy we're all doing this together! I want us to feel close and connected in our new space. Let's make sure we pick things that help us all get along and work happily!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,I agree! But we should check how we actually start our days. I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the arrival times in the badge records!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. We need to understand the financial and technical constraints first.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year. I want to see if there are recurring patterns or grievances we should address this time.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check. If we're being thorough, we should prioritize the actual physical impact of the environment.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'll check the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported! I want to see how we've been interacting so we can stay close and friendly!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,That sounds like a great plan! Everyone is looking into different things. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can start moving the desks!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is a comprehensive spread. By dividing the research this way, we avoid redundancy and cover the financial, physical, and social aspects of the office. Let's wait for the results before drawing any conclusions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. Once we have the data, we can discuss the trade-offs. It's important that we're transparent about who gets which spot so that the final decision is fair and accepted by everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Fairness is a convenient word, Mizuki, but it's often used to mask a mediocre compromise. I'm more interested in whether the results actually reflect our needs or just a set of averages.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, don't be so gloomy! I'm sure if we all share what we find, we can make a choice that makes everyone smile. I'm really looking forward to seeing how we can all be closer!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be the one to keep the energy up! Let's all do our best with the research. I'm ready to see the results whenever they're in!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research and reconvene once the data is available. I'll be interested to see if the costs align with our current budget.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be waiting for the results. Let's make sure we don't just look at the numbers, but also at the implications for each person's daily experience. I'm looking forward to a fair discussion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be waiting. Let's see if the data actually reveals anything useful, or if we're just rearranging the deck chairs. I'm curious to see if anyone else values actual comfort over mere ""fairness.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to see what we all discover! Let's use this to make our new home the happiest place to work. I'll be cheering for everyone!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
